ory of splitting tickets.", "history": [{"date": "2026-09-22", "p_dem": 0.7982, "margin": 5.28}, {"date": "2026-09-23", "p_dem": 0.8298, "margin": 6.0}, {"date": "2026-09-24", "p_dem": 0.8404, "margin": 6.5}]}